# Motion

Motion plays once, stays small, and stops when `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` is set. No infinite pulse, ping, bounce, or shimmer.

Allowed React Bits source, and only here:

- `src/components/react-bits/BlurText.tsx` on the home `h1`
- `src/components/react-bits/DecryptedText.tsx` on one terminal line
- `src/components/react-bits/Counter.tsx` on the billing credit figure only

```tsx
<BlurText text="A Next.js 15 AI SaaS boilerplate you run yourself." animateBy="words" delay={30} />
<DecryptedText text="docker compose up -d && npm run dev" animateOn="view" sequential />
<Counter value={credits} />
```

Do not add Aurora, Particles, Hyperspeed, SplashCursor, ShinyText, GradientText, GlareHover, Center Flow, Agent Activity, or another text effect. Do not install a second motion library. New animation needs a reason a static layout cannot carry. Dashboard, chat, and auth do not import these except the billing counter.
